del","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1599,"retries":0},{"seq":301,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 8. My doctrine says take the east ford (F3) in the first 5 watches, which is late. I must reinforce F3. Kite-inf-1/arch-1 are at F3, but need support. I will move my elephants and cavalry to support F3 and secure it."},{"seq":302,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c124","house":"kite","letter":"L151","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":2100,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":303,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c125","house":"kite","letter":"L152","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":2100,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":304,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1717,"retries":0},{"seq":305,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My forces are spread out, holding F1 and F2. Rhino has units at F2. I must consolidate and react to Rhino's presence. I will use the doctrine: hold forts, defend. I need to reinforce F1 and F2, and potentially harass Rhino.\n\nRhino units at F2 (2w ago) suggest a threat there."},{"seq":306,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c126","house":"orchid","letter":"L153","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":307,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c127","house":"orchid","letter":"L154","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":308,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c128","house":"orchid","letter":"L155","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":2100,"plain":"BOWMEN, SCOUT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":309,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1676,"retries":0},{"seq":310,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Doctrine requires taking the west ford (F1) first. Tiger inf units are near S-West (F1). I will move my inf units to F1 to secure it. I must code all communications. I will send a cipher letter to Orchid to attempt the truce early."},{"seq":311,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c129","house":"tiger","letter":"L156","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":312,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c130","house":"tiger","letter":"L157","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"OPRKJI EKKQ, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":313,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c131","house":"tiger","letter":"L158","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"QNURP"},{"seq":314,"t":2100,"type":"delivered","courier":"c120","letter":"L146","house":"tiger"},{"seq":315,"t":2104,"type":"caught","courier":"c114","letter":"L139","house":"orchid","by":"tiger-inf-2","x":200,"y":506},{"seq":316,"t":2109,"type":"delivered","courier":"c94","letter":"L119","house":"rhino"},{"seq":317,"t":2109,"type":"delivered","courier":"c95","letter":"L120","house":"rhino"},{"seq":318,"t":2118,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"tiger-inf-1","x":219,"y":515},{"seq":319,"t":2118,"type":"clash","a":"tiger-inf-1","b":"orchid-inf-1","x":200,"y":500},{"seq":320,"t":2135,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-arch-1","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":200,"y":525},{"seq":321,"t":2149,"type":"delivered","courier":"c92","letter":"L117","house":"tiger"},{"seq":322,"t":2158,"type":"killed","courier":"c91","letter":"L116","house":"tiger","by":"orchid-arch-1","x":200,"y":589},{"seq":323